&lt;li&gt;
&lt;a href="https://vercel.com/kb/guide/ai-gateway-and-ai-sdk" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Vercel — Build AI Agents with AI SDK and AI Gateway&lt;/a&gt; — AI SDK and Workflow integration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;a href="https://vercel.com/kb/workflow-sdk" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Vercel — Workflow SDK&lt;/a&gt; — Durable functions, steps, and execution model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;a href="https://vercel.com/kb/guide/durableagent-to-workflowagent" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Vercel — Migrate from DurableAgent to WorkflowAgent&lt;/a&gt; — AI SDK v7 integration changes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;


LangGraph
&lt;/h3&gt;

